    {
      "id": "txt001",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 359.6,
      "height": 25.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 7919,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 104729,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "What an optimization level is",
      "originalText": "What an optimization level is",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "txt002",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 40,
      "width": 863.04,
      "height": 20.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 15838,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 209458,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Four integers, and a table that reads them. There is no list anywhere of what -O2 does.",
      "originalText": "Four integers, and a table that reads them. There is no list anywhere of what -O2 does.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "txt003",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 100,
      "width": 644.8,
      "height": 180.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 23757,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 314187,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "           optimize  optimize_size  optimize_debug  optimize_fast\n  -O0             0              0               0              0\n  -O1             1              0               0              0\n  -O2             2              0               0              0\n  -O3             3              0               0              0\n  -Os             2              1               0              0\n  -Oz             2              2               0              0\n  -Og             1              0               1              0\n  -Ofast          3              0               0              1",
      "originalText": "           optimize  optimize_size  optimize_debug  optimize_fast\n  -O0             0              0               0              0\n  -O1             1              0               0              0\n  -O2             2              0               0              0\n  -O3             3              0               0              0\n  -Os             2              1               0              0\n  -Oz             2              2               0              0\n  -Og             1              0               1              0\n  -Ofast          3              0               0              1",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "txt004",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 340,
      "width": 758.88,
      "height": 85.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 31676,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 418916,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "-Os and -Oz differ in one integer, and the table takes that integer as a\nyes or no. Both are yes. That is why the two print byte identical tables\nand are still not the same compiler: the difference is read later, by\ncode that looks at the number rather than at whether it is zero.",
      "originalText": "-Os and -Oz differ in one integer, and the table takes that integer as a\nyes or no. Both are yes. That is why the two print byte identical tables\nand are still not the same compiler: the difference is read later, by\ncode that looks at the number rather than at whether it is zero.",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "txt005",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 820,
      "y": 100,
      "width": 400.52,
      "height": 233.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 39595,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 523645,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The table is 114 rows.\n\nEach row is a first word saying when,\nan option, an argument, and a value.\nThere are 12 words to choose from and\nGCC 16 uses 6 of them.\n\nEvery row is read at every level. A\nlevel does not pick rows. It hands the\nswitch four integers and the rows sort\nthemselves out.",
      "originalText": "The table is 114 rows.\n\nEach row is a first word saying when,\nan option, an argument, and a value.\nThere are 12 words to choose from and\nGCC 16 uses 6 of them.\n\nEvery row is read at every level. A\nlevel does not pick rows. It hands the\nswitch four integers and the rows sort\nthemselves out.",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
