      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "false does not mean left alone.\nThe same function turns the option\noff, with the value negated, as long\nas the row has no argument. So -Os\nis not -O2 minus a few rows. It is\n-O2 with those rows arguing the\nother way.",
      "originalText": "false does not mean left alone.\nThe same function turns the option\noff, with the value negated, as long\nas the row has no argument. So -Os\nis not -O2 minus a few rows. It is\n-O2 with those rows arguing the\nother way.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
